{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/en_-_Wishlist_Section_Banner__616_x_222px_.png?t=1748201483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/BS_GIF_1.gif?t=1748201483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Breach Signal is a 1\u20136 player online co-op psychological horror game. You\u2019ve been recruited into the [REDACTED] program, an initiative led by the para-governmental <strong>Federal Normality Agency</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your mission</strong>: investigate <strong>dimensional breaches</strong>, unstable phenomena that distort reality and open passages to the unknown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lead scientific expeditions</strong>: identify <strong>Anchor Objects</strong>, retrieve samples for the Agency, and confront the <span class=\"bb_strike\">un</span>explainable.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equipped with a <strong>cutting-edge technology case </strong>and investigation tools, you operate within a retrofuturistic 80s world soaked in <strong>cosmic horror</strong> and bureaucratic secrecy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/BS_GIF_2.gif?t=1748201483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/en_-_Divider_Section_Banner_-_Inside_The_Domes__616_x_60px_.png?t=1748201483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">/!\\ Once inside the Domes, all contact with the outside is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Semi-Open Map</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a stylized, semi-open environment where you can get truly lost\u2026 <span class=\"bb_strike\">for your own pleasure!</span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedural Investigations</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each expedition is different: randomized spawn points, evolving objectives and dynamic threats ensure no session feels the same.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Analog Tech &amp; Tools</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use unique, retro-futuristic investigation devices such as signal tracker, sampler, scanners and more, to detect anomalous entities and objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/BS_GIF_3.gif?t=1748201483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/en_-_Divider_Section_Banner_-_Co-op_Protocols__616_x_60px_.png?t=1748201483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay close to your team... What lies beyond remains unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Team-Based Survival</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work together with 1\u20136 players in an expedition where communication is essential.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use proximity voice chat to communicate with other recruits, or your Talkie to communicate from a greater range. But be careful, you may not be the only one listening...\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Efficient Deployment</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic team planning ensures maximum sample recovery! With more credits, better gear follows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make it back with samples... and <i>some</i> memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/BS_GIF_4.gif?t=1748201483\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2546650?t=1748201483","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/1eeb6da96407ff85aff29e095cdba3191169a03b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748201483","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/0cf93de4044043582b0c4ea6d57bbc360b053e80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748201483","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/0cf93de4044043582b0c4ea6d57bbc360b053e80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748201483","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Congratulations, recruits.</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/en_-_Discord_Section_Banner__616_x_222px_.png?t=1748201483\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/en_-_Wishlist_Section_Banner__616_x_222px_.png?t=1748201483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/BS_GIF_1.gif?t=1748201483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Breach Signal is a 1\u20136 player online co-op psychological horror game. You\u2019ve been recruited into the [REDACTED] program, an initiative led by the para-governmental <strong>Federal Normality Agency</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your mission</strong>: investigate <strong>dimensional breaches</strong>, unstable phenomena that distort reality and open passages to the unknown.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lead scientific expeditions</strong>: identify <strong>Anchor Objects</strong>, retrieve samples for the Agency, and confront the <span class=\"bb_strike\">un</span>explainable.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equipped with a <strong>cutting-edge technology case </strong>and investigation tools, you operate within a retrofuturistic 80s world soaked in <strong>cosmic horror</strong> and bureaucratic secrecy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/BS_GIF_2.gif?t=1748201483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/en_-_Divider_Section_Banner_-_Inside_The_Domes__616_x_60px_.png?t=1748201483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">/!\\ Once inside the Domes, all contact with the outside is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Semi-Open Map</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a stylized, semi-open environment where you can get truly lost\u2026 <span class=\"bb_strike\">for your own pleasure!</span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedural Investigations</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each expedition is different: randomized spawn points, evolving objectives and dynamic threats ensure no session feels the same.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Analog Tech &amp; Tools</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use unique, retro-futuristic investigation devices such as signal tracker, sampler, scanners and more, to detect anomalous entities and objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/BS_GIF_3.gif?t=1748201483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2546650/extras/en_-_Divider_Section_Banner_-_Co-op_Protocols__616_x_60px_.png?t=1748201483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay close to your team... What lies beyond remains unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Team-Based Survival</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work together with 1\u20136 players in an expedition where communication is essential.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use proximity voice chat to communicate with other recruits, or your Talkie to communicate from a greater range. But be careful, you may not be the only one listening...\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Efficient Deployment</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic team planning ensures maximum sample recovery! With more credits, better gear follows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make it back with samples... and <i>some</i> memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://